"description":"Carely is a social journal app for sharing real moments with no pressure.\n\nCheck in once a day or whenever something’s happening. Share your mood, a short note, or where you’re at. Keep it private or visible to friends. No feeds for strangers. No pressure to post.\n\nWhether you’re meeting friends nearby, reflecting on your day, or just checking in, Carely fits naturally into daily life.\n\nWhat you can do:\n- Check in anytime\nShare a moment with your mood, a message, or a location.\n- Stay connected\nSee friends’ check-ins and status updates — shared on their terms.\n- Choose your privacy\nKeep check-ins just for yourself or share with friends and family.\n- Build a gentle habit\nTrack streaks, revisit past moments, and see mood patterns over time.\n- Quiet reassurance\nIf you stop checking in for a set period, your selected contacts can be notified — even if they don’t have the app.\n\nCarely is not a discovery social network.\nIt’s a small space for the people who matter.\nCheck in. Stay connected.\n\nTerms of Use: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nPrivacy Policy: https://carely.morsl.ai/privacy", "sellerUrl":"http://carely.morsl.ai", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"48460800", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":14, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.7857099999999999084820956340990960597991943359375, "artistId":1869487415, "artistName":"Peikai Mo", "userRatingCount":14}, 
