"description":"Carely is a personal care assistant designed to help you organize and monitor the health and care routines of your loved ones.\n\nCreate separate profiles for parents, grandparents, family members, or anyone under your care, and manage all important health information in one secure place.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Multiple loved one profiles\n• Medication tracking and reminders\n• Medication inventory monitoring\n• Blood pressure, blood glucose, and weight records\n• Doctor and hospital appointment management\n• Health condition journal\n• Emergency medical information card\n• Prescription, report, and test result archive\n• Vaccination and routine checkup tracking\n• PDF health summary reports\n• Data import and export\n• Home screen widget support\n\nPrivacy First\n\nYour privacy is our priority.\n\nCarely does not require a user account.\n\nAll data is stored locally on your device. No information is transmitted to servers, shared with third parties, or used for analytics and tracking purposes.\n\nCarely is completely free and contains no advertisements.\n\nDesigned to make caring for your loved ones easier, more organized, and more secure.", "sellerUrl":"https://sites.google.com/dreamercreativeagency.com/carely/home", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"3959808", "formattedPrice":"$1.99", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":0, "trackContentRating":"4+", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":0, "artistId":1896329978, "artistName":"Berfin ilayda Aydinli", "userRatingCount":0}]
